{#- record/views.d/manuscript.md.j2
    Macros every manuscript view imports (ADR-067). A per-work template is
    two lines: import, then call with the WORK's code. Layout only; the
    text is the WORK's and its SECTIONs'. -#}

{%- macro latest(d) -%}
{%- set ns = namespace(v=d.date | string) -%}
{%- if d.history is defined and d.history -%}
{%- for h in d.history if h.date is defined and (h.date | string) > ns.v -%}{%- set ns.v = h.date | string -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{{ ns.v }}
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro manuscript(code) -%}
{%- set w = doc(code) -%}
# {{ w.title }}
{{ "\n*" ~ w.subtitle ~ "*\n" if w.subtitle is defined else "" }}
## Abstract

{{ w.part("Abstract") }}
{% for s in w.sections %}

## {{ loop.index }}. {{ s.title }}

{{ s.part("Manuscript text") }}
{% endfor %}

---

*Assembled from {{ w.code }} and its sections. Edit those, not this page.
What each section asserts and discusses, and how that stands in the record,
is in the ledger.*
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro row(c, since, text) -%}
| {{ c.code }} | {{ c.status }}{% if c.warrant is defined and c.warrant %}, {{ c.warrant }}{% endif %} | {{ c.title | truncate(160) }} |{% if latest(c) > since %} revised {{ latest(c) }}{% endif %}{% if c.code not in text %} **in no paragraph**{% endif %} |
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro ledger(code) -%}
{%- set w = doc(code) -%}
# {{ w.title }}: ledger

What each section of {{ w.code }} does with the record's argument. A section
**asserts** what it stakes the work on and **discusses** what it uses without
staking the work on it; each paragraph says which in a directive. A claim's
status is the record's credence, not the manuscript's: asserting a Proposed
claim is staking the work on something the record has not accepted. "Revised"
marks an entry changed after the section was last revised, so the prose may
be stale. "In no paragraph" marks a field entry that no paragraph's
directive states any more: the prose it anchored was cut.
{% set ns = namespace(placed=[], staked=[]) %}
{%- for s in w.sections %}
{%- set since = latest(s) %}
{%- set text = s.part("Manuscript text") %}

## {{ loop.index }}. {{ s.title }} ({{ s.code }}, revised {{ since }})

| Asserts | Status | Title | Flags |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in s.asserts -%}
{{ row(c, since, text) }}
{% set ns.placed = ns.placed + [c.code] -%}
{% if c.status != "Active" %}{% set ns.staked = ns.staked + [c] %}{% endif -%}
{% else -%}
| — | | | |
{% endfor %}
| Discusses | Status | Title | Flags |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in s.discusses -%}
{{ row(c, since, text) }}
{% set ns.placed = ns.placed + [c.code] -%}
{% else -%}
| — | | | |
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor %}

## Staked but not held

Asserted by a section while the record does not hold them Active.

{% for c in ns.staked | unique(attribute="code") -%}
- {{ c.code }} ({{ c.status }}): {{ c.title | truncate(200) }}
{% else -%}
- None.
{% endfor %}

## Members not placed

In {{ w.code }} but neither asserted nor discussed by any section: dropped, or
not yet written in.

{% set ns2 = namespace(any=false) -%}
{% for c in docs("CLAIM") if code in (c.works | map(attribute="code") | list) and c.code not in ns.placed -%}
{% set ns2.any = true -%}
- {{ c.code }} ({{ c.status }}): {{ c.title | truncate(200) }}
{% endfor -%}
{% if not ns2.any %}- None.
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
